'''Talent Orbs''' (本能玉, ''Hon'nō-dama'', '''Instinct Orbs'''), also known as just '''Orbs''', are a feature implemented in [[Version 9.7 Update|Version 9.7]]. This feature allows players to improve certain [[True Form]] and [[Ultra Form]] Cats' stats and abilities against one of many enemy traits or give them new abilities. Talent Orbs become available after clearing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Overview==
A Talent Orb is a type of item which can be given to a unit from the [[Upgrade Menu]] by going left in the [[Talents]] upgrade screen. Each unit can only hold one Talent Orb at a time, except for [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cats]] with access to Ultra Talents, which can equip up to two Talent Orbs when at level 60 or above. Once equipped, a Talent Orb can still be powered up through merging, or it can be removed for 10 NP. Talent Orbs exist in different Ranks and can be obtained from certain [[Enigma Stages]], [[Island of Hidden Treasure]], [[Gauntlet#Colossus Gauntlets|Colossus Gauntlet]]s and Arena of Destiny events in the Ranking Dojo or by merging lower-Rank Talent Orbs of the exact same Rank, Target and Type. Talent Orbs have their own section in the Storage alongside Cats and [[Catfruit]], where they can be merged or sold for NP.

