==Orb Types==
Each Orb has a '''Rank''' (ランク, ''Ranku'') and either an '''Effect''' (効果, ''Kōka'') or '''Ability''' (能力, ''Nōryoku''). Each Effect Orb is limited by a '''Target''' (ターゲット, ''Tāgetto'') trait like [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] or [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]], while Ability Orbs activate against all enemies or against special enemy types like [[:Category:Colossus Enemies|Colossus]]. Ability Orbs were first introduced in [[Version 14.3 Update|Version 14.3]] and are obtained from Arena of Destiny events in the Ranking Dojo.

Effect Orbs have a different color and texture depending on their Target (e.g., [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] Orbs are green with spirals). Ability Orbs have an iridescent design somewhat similar to the [[:Category:Legend Rare Cats|Legend Rare Cats]]' crystals.

