==='''Effect Orb Types'''===
*'''Attack Up''' (ダメージアップ, ''Damēji Appu''): Deals more damage to Target.
*'''Defense Up''' (ダメージ軽減, ''Damēji Keigen''): Receives less damage from Target.
*'''Strong Effect Up''' (めっぽう強い強化, ''Meppō Tsuyoi Kyōka''): Reduces damage taken from a trait, as well as increasing the damage multiplier from the Strong Against ability. Can only be equipped by [[:Category:Cats with Strong ability|units with Strong Against abilities]] targeting the same trait as the Orb.
*'''Massive Damage Up''' (超ダメージ強化, ''Chō Damēji Kyōka''): Increases the damage multiplier from the Massive Damage ability. Can only be equipped by [[:Category:Cats with Massive Damage ability|units with Massive Damage abilities]] targeting the same trait as the Orb.
*'''Tough Effect Up''' (打たれ強い強化, ''Utare Tsuyoi Kyōka''): Reduces damage taken from a trait. Can only be equipped by [[:Category:Cats with Resistant ability|units with Resistant abilities]] targeting the same trait as the Orb.

'''''Note:''' Effect Orbs do not add a target trait to units with anti-trait abilities, but merely improve attack, defense or abilities against that target trait.''

For example: If [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Roe Cat]] is given a '''Defense Up S: Floating''' Orb, it will take less damage from [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] attacks in comparison to non-[[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemies. However, the Orb does not grant it the ability to actually target Floating, so it cannot Weaken them, nor is it able to tank Floating enemies as well as Reds. Conversely, as Curse does not disable Effect Orbs, it will still retain increased defense versus Floating, even if the ability to Resist/Weaken Reds is not available.

