==='''Ability Orb Types'''===
*'''Mini-Deathsurge''' (デス小烈波, ''Desu Shō Reppa''): Every second unit deployed has a 100% chance to create a Lv.1 [[Mini-Surge]] at 200~500 upon death. These are weaker than standard Mini-Surges, except in the case of S-Rank Orbs. When two are equipped by the same unit, only one will take effect; the higher-Ranked Orb has priority.
*'''Resist Waves''' (波動ダメージ耐性, ''Hadō Damēji Taisei''): Reduces damage the unit receives from [[Wave Attack]]s. Becomes immunity with either two S-Rank Resist Waves Orbs or one S-Rank Resist Waves Orb and a level 10 Resist Wave [[Talents|Talent]].
*'''Cash Back''' (キャッシュバック, ''Kyasshu Bakku''): Every second unit deployed refunds a % of their cost upon death. Becomes a full refund with two S-Rank Cash Back Orbs.
*'''Resist Knockback''' (ふっとばし耐性, ''Futtobashi Taisei''): Reduces the distance the unit is pushed back by Knockback effects. Becomes immunity with either two S-Rank Resist Knockback Orbs or one S-Rank Resist Knockback Orb and a level 10 Resist Knockback Talent.
*'''Boost Stories of Legend''' (レジェンドストーリー強化, ''Rejendo Sutōrī Kyōka''): Increases health and attack power in [[Stories of Legend]]. It has no effect in other stages such as [[Uncanny Legends]], [[Zero Legends]] or [[Event Stages]]. When two are equipped by the same unit, only one will take effect; the higher-Ranked Orb has priority.
*'''Colossus Slayer''' (超生命体特効, ''Chō Seimeitai Tokkō''): Every second unit deployed has increased health and attack power against [[:Category:Colossus Enemies|Colossus Enemies]]. This does not stack with pre-existing Colossus Slayer abilities. When two of the orb are equipped by the same unit, only one will take effect; the higher-Ranked Orb has priority.
*'''Cat Cannon Charge''' (にゃんこ砲チャージ ''Nyanko-hō Chāji''): Every second unit deployed partially recharges the [[Cat Cannon]] upon death. When two are equipped by the same unit, only one will take effect; the higher-Ranked Orb has priority.
*'''Resist Toxic''' (毒撃ダメージ耐性 ''Dokugeki Damēji Taisei''): Reduces damage received from Toxic attacks. Becomes immunity with either two S-Rank Resist Toxic Orbs or one S-Rank Resist Toxic Orb and a level 10 Resist Toxic [[Talents|Talent]].
*'''Dodge Attack (All)''' (全攻撃無効 ''Zen Kōgeki Mukō''): Every second unit deployed has a chance to dodge attacks for 1 second. This works against all enemies, including non-standard types like [[:Category:Typeless Enemies|Typeless]], [[:Category:Witch Enemies|Witch]] and [[:Category:EVA Angel Enemies|EVA Angel]]. Units with pre-existing Dodge Attack abilities will have both theirs and the Orb's. When two are equipped by the same unit, only one will take effect; the higher-Ranked Orb has priority.
*'''Resist Slow''' (動きを遅くする耐性 ''Ugoki o Osoku Suru Taisei''): Reduces the duration of slow effects. Can stack with another Resist Slow Orb or Resist Slow Talents to become immunity.
*'''Resist Curse''' (古代の呪い耐性 ''Kodai no Noroi Taisei''): Reduces the duration of curse effects. Can stack with another Resist Curse Orb or Resist Curse Talents to become immunity.
*'''Boost Uncanny Legends''' : Increases health and attack power in [[Uncanny Legends]]. When two are equipped by the same unit, only one will take effect; the higher-Ranked Orb has priority.
*'''Single Surge Counter''' (１回烈波カウンター ''1-kai Reppa Kauntā''): Every second unit deployed will do a [[Counter-Surge]] the first time it is hit by a [[Surge Attack]]. The damage dealt by these Surges will be weaker than the user's base damage, with the exception of the S-rank version. Does not stack with pre-existing Counter-Surge abilities. When two are equipped by the same unit, only one will take effect; the higher-Ranked Orb has priority. Will have no effect when equipped by [[:Category:Cats with Surge Immunity|Cats with Surge Immunity]].
*'''Berserker''' (撃破時攻撃力アップ ''Gekiha-ji Kōgeki-ryoku Appu''): Increases attack power by a set % after defeating 10 enemies. Stacks multiplicatively with pre-existing Strengthen abilities. When two are equipped by the same unit, only one will take effect; the higher-Ranked Orb has priority.
*'''Shortened Cooldown''' (生産時間短縮 ''Seisan Jikan Tanshuku''): Every second unit deployed starts their cooldown with a set % of their cooldown already completed. Does not stack with pre-existing Shortened Cooldown abilities. When two are equipped by the same unit, only one will take effect; the higher-Ranked Orb has priority.
*'''Resist Freeze''' (動きを止める耐性 ''Ugoki o Tomeru Taisei''): Reduces the duration of freeze effects. Can stack with another Resist Freeze Orb or Resist Freeze Talents to become immunity.
*'''Resist Weaken''' (攻撃力ダウン耐性 ''Kōgeki-ryoku Daun Taisei''): Reduces the duration of weaken effects. Can stack with another Resist Weaken Orb or Resist Weaken Talents to become immunity.
*'''Cost Down''' (生産コスト割引 ''Seisan Kosuto Waribiki''): Every second unit deployed receives a set % discount to their cost.
*'''Resist Surges''' (烈波ダメージ耐性 ''Reppa Damēji Taisei''): Reduces damage the unit receives from [[Surge Attack]]s. Becomes immunity with either two S-Rank Resist Surges Orbs or one S-Rank Resist Surges Orb and a level 10 Resist Surge Talent.
*'''First Bounty Up''' (初回撃破時お金アップ ''Shokai Gekiha-ji Okane Appu''): Every second unit deployed gains a set % of extra money from their first kill (applies to all enemies killed by an Area Attack, but not [[Wave Attack|Waves]], [[Surge Attack|Surges]] or [[Explosion]]s). Stacks additively with the Money Up ability. When two are equipped by the same unit, only one will take effect; the higher-Ranked Orb has priority.
*'''Resists Explosions''' (爆波ダメージ耐性 ''Bakuha Damēji Taisei''): Reduces damage the unit receives from [[Explosion]]s. Becomes immunity with two S-Rank Resists Explosions Orbs.

