==='''Treasure Chests'''===
Treasure Chests are currently the only way to obtain Ability Orbs and are awarded at the end of the [[Catclaw Dojo]]'s [[Arena of Destiny]] events. Chests appear in the Talent Orb Storage and come in 3 rarities: Bronze, Silver and Gold. Bronze Chests drop D-rank Ability Orbs, Silver Chests drop C-rank Ability Orbs and Gold Chests drop B-rank Ability Orbs. All Ability Orbs have an equal chance of being received from a Treasure Chest, and the resulting Orb can be rerolled for 30 [[Cat Food]], which will also remove the rerolled Orb from the Chest's pool of options. Treasure Chests will only drop 6 Orbs, with the types of available Orbs being dependent on which Arena of Destiny Dojo the chest was obtained from.

